  "verify": "From Guition's own pin table, factory sketches and TFT_eSPI User_Setup.h for this board (mirrored at github.com/maxpill/JC2432W328): ST7789 on SCK 14, MOSI 13, MISO 12, CS 15, DC 2, no reset line; BGR, inversion off; backlight GPIO 27; XPT2046 on the panel's SPI lines with CS 33 and IRQ 36; TF card on 18/19/23 with CS 5; RGB LED on 4/16/17 lit low; speaker on GPIO 26; light sensor on GPIO 34. Not seen on the glass here - nobody has the board. If the picture is a negative, turn Invert on; if red and blue are swapped, set RGB. Guition's own code runs the panel at 55 MHz and openHASP at 24 MHz; if the picture breaks up, lower the SPI speed on the Display tab. If the back is marked C, use the JC2432W328C preset.",
